# Corpus Q&A for agents (no OpenAI in scripts)

Part of **bot-quality-evaluation** / KB prep. Load `.cursor/skills/bot-quality-evaluation/SKILL.md` for full eval workflows.

1. From repo root: `./scripts/kb.sh qa-export --seed <n>` (optional: `--count`, `--max-context-tokens`, `--out path`).
2. Open **`pinecone-pipeline/agent_exports/corpus_qa_for_cursor.md`** (or custom `--out`).
3. For each **Document** section: read chunk excerpts, fill the **Agent — fill in** table from quoted chunks only.

Optional JSON: `--format json --out agent_exports/bundle.json`.

Only use **`--fill-with-openai`** if the user explicitly wants API-filled JSON and has `OPENAI_API_KEY` set.

Validate with `./scripts/bot.sh rag` / `probe` — see [corpus-qa-evaluation.md](../skills/bot-quality-evaluation/corpus-qa-evaluation.md).
